OL,3,AMore women make allegations against
OL,4,ARussell Brand
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this story contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FMore women have come forward to make
OL,10,Fallegations about disgraced entertainer
OL,11,FRussell Brand, in interviews with the
OL,12,FTimes and a new Netflix documentary.
OL,14,FBrand was jailed earlier this week
OL,15,Fafter being found guilty of one count
OL,16,Fof rape and three of sexual assault at
OL,17,Fa trial in London.
OL,19,FAllegations against him first emerged
OL,20,Fafter an investigation by the Times,
OL,21,Fthe Sunday Times and Channel 4's
OL,22,FDispatches in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
